{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "fff994f222eddbd0fc4f9b2de1542f0a3adee1ebdae112e56976ff74e3fad2f1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ♪\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生♪\n辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1002_p", "source_sha256": "83f83d3ea32daa4a2f684da25bf02ad794c62d2737a847df6ffb393cbf212554", "ja": "お疲れ、未来。ミニライブだったけど、\n未来らしいステージでよかったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。虽然是场迷你演唱会，\n但表演得很有未来的风格，很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "9fbef3f115e0854a99c80414b667ea94fd4660312a2e8135ef902dabf862b2ab", "ja": "えへへ、ホントですか？　\n劇場よりみんなとの距離が近いから、緊張しました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗？\n和大家的距离比在剧场时还更近，让我好紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1004_p", "source_sha256": "686044015fa0b46880880b27a5205f446204410cd466ec7f397195d87f007510", "ja": "緊張してたのか？\nあまりそうは見えなかったけど……。", "zh": "你很紧张吗？\n我倒是看不太出来啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "eee372ce1722d17b8c4ff6e7b64026bc95be438daa90e89c1c22b2e23f27d618", "ja": "はい！　なので、本番前はずーっと、\n{$P$}さんのことを見てました！", "zh": "是的！因此，我在正式上场前，\n就一直看着{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba239aa248517b9a07260ae0c841c186190196d75711bba7522fdfbaaf76b93a", "ja": "だから、ちっとも緊張しませんでしたよ♪\n{$P$}さんってお守りみたいですね！", "zh": "所以，才完全不觉得紧张喔♪\n{$P$}先生就像是护身符呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
